	/**
	 * Validate workspace queue for scheduling
	 *
	 * Checks for:
	 * - Dependency cycles
	 * - Invalid dependencies
	 * - Potential deadlocks
	 *
	 * @param workspaces - Workspaces to validate
	 * @returns Validation result
